{{bug|Familiars with levels/stages will revert to their base form upon exiting the sub-area as the game does not internally store their levels. This includes, but is not limited to: {{i|Bumbo}}, {{i|Guppy's Hairball}}, etc.}}
{{bug|If {{e|Mother's Shadow}} kills Issac as he exits the sub-area, after his death animation finishes, the game will crash.}}

